## Third-party and proprietary components

This tree bundles and/or analyses material that is **not** the author's work
and remains the property of its respective rights holders. In particular:

| Component | Location in this repo | Rights holder |
|---|---|---|
| TypingMaster 12.0.1.981 (program, lessons, sounds, images, manuals, wordlists) | `app/`, `prefix/` | Cloud Kayak Labs / its successors — commercial, proprietary |
| Decrypted memory image and Ghidra decompilation derived from the above | `unpacked/`, `native-re/` | derived work of the above |
| Extracted PE resources (screens, cursors, bitmaps, style) | `resources/` | derived work of the above |
| Wine engine and libraries | `runtime/app-files/` | Wine project — LGPL-2.1-or-later |
| Freedesktop / Flatpak platform runtime and libraries | `runtime/platform-files/` | respective upstream projects (LGPL, MIT, BSD, GPL, …) |

The licenses of the third-party runtime components remain in full force; their
original license texts ship alongside them inside `runtime/`. Nothing in this
repository re-licenses those components.

Because this repository contains proprietary third-party software, it must not
be made public, redistributed, sold, or used to circumvent licensing.

See `NOTICE.md` for upstream attribution and `DOCUMENTATION.md` §7 for the
project's stated legal boundary.
